[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-1
STATUS: Approved
TITLE: Brake pressure limit
STATEMENT: >>>
The controller shall limit brake pressure to the limit of the active mode.

| Mode | Limit (bar) |
|------|-------------|
| ABS  | 180         |
| Park | 60          |

![Pressure over time in ABS mode](_assets/pressure-curve.png)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    Idle --> Braking
```
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Higher pressure locks the wheels on low-friction surfaces.
<<<
